Comment:
 scrubbed statically links or dynamically links/dlopen's several
 third-party components (SQLite, Lexbor, Zstandard, argparse, the WHATWG
 HTML named-character-reference table, system libcurl, and system libz).
 The full, individually-attributed provenance, license text, and exact
 pinned versions for every one of those components is bundled unmodified
 at /usr/share/doc/scrubbed/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md -- this file is not a
 substitute for it and does not restate its per-component license grants.

